{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>His hand [stretched].</b> The form and the meaning are like מכה." "<b>מעוזניה.</b> An allusion to Tyre, and the nun is in place of the swallowed dagesh. Also, Canaan means merchant. Some say that the word ארחת כנען is missing, because מעוזניה is feminine."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:48.713982004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}